### Archivo compatible con REST Client de VS Code; mantiene cookies si están habilitadas.
### Solo datos de demostración; iniciar Uvicorn local antes de usar.
@base = http://127.0.0.1:8000

GET {{base}}/api/health

### Login
POST {{base}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"ana","password":"Demo123!"}

### Cuentas propias (cookie de la respuesta anterior)
GET {{base}}/api/accounts

### Transferencia simulada
POST {{base}}/api/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
X-Lab-Request: 1

{"source":"LAB-ANA-01","destination":"LAB-ANA-02","amount":"10.25","note":"Ejercicio manual API"}

### Negativo: no debe modificar estado
POST {{base}}/api/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
X-Lab-Request: 1

{"source":"LAB-ANA-01","destination":"LAB-ANA-02","amount":"-1"}

### Historial
GET {{base}}/api/transfers

### Logout
POST {{base}}/api/logout
X-Lab-Request: 1
